      <termEntry id="c-7a8f1f56d7b12527">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>Exempts the multi-format documentation max-info panels sub-metric of the documentation axis: the panels are measured for adoption as they land, and their producer is not yet in-repo.</term>
          </tig>
