      <termEntry id="c-893bb2689e7f3579">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>The signature (p, q) of a real quadratic space, metric tensor, quadratic form, or Clifford algebra: the counts carried by math:signaturePositive and math:signatureNegative. Structured, not an opaque string — Riemannian is (n, 0), Lorentzian is (1, n−1) or (n−1, 1), and Cl(p,q) uses the same ordered sign counts. The sum p + q equals the carrier dimension; the object is shared rather than re-minted for Clifford semantics.</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="fr">
          <tig>
            <term>La signature (p, q) partagée d'un espace quadratique réel, tenseur métrique, forme quadratique ou algèbre de Clifford, portée par math:signaturePositive et math:signatureNegative. Elle est structurée ; p + q égale la dimension du support.</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="zh">
          <tig>
            <term>实二次空间、度量张量、二次形式或 Clifford 代数共享的签名 (p,q)，由 math:signaturePositive 与 math:signatureNegative 承载。它是结构化对象，且 p+q 等于载体维数。</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
      </termEntry>
      <termEntry id="c-893def1029a6202f">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>Reconstruction Map</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="fr">
