      <termEntry id="c-a5833d83fd8c0db4">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>Names the datarange qualifying a cardinality restriction. It is not the base datatype of a logic:Datarange expression; it lowers to owl:onDataRange.</term>
