          <tig>
            <term>Prose Quality</term>
          </tig>
          <tig>
            <term>prose quality</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="fr">
          <tig>
            <term>Qualité de la prose</term>
          </tig>
          <tig>
            <term>qualité de la prose</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
      </termEntry>
      <termEntry id="c-b875eda85600ac69">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>A scalar function on a symplectic state space whose symplectic gradient generates the Hamiltonian flow.</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="fr">
          <tig>
            <term>Une fonction scalaire sur un espace d'états symplectique dont le gradient symplectique engendre le flot hamiltonien.</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
        <langSet xml:lang="zh">
          <tig>
            <term>辛状态空间上的标量函数，其辛梯度生成哈密顿流。</term>
          </tig>
        </langSet>
      </termEntry>
      <termEntry id="c-b889e110be9edb46">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>The committed raise-only measured-score floor for the axisProvenanceHonesty quality axis on the math slice; the gate reds if the slice's measured score falls below it.</term>
