      <termEntry id="c-f7f2b9edf5074d01">
        <langSet xml:lang="en">
          <tig>
            <term>The GMEOW Slice-Quality Rubric Module — classes, properties, and individuals of the GMEOW super-vocabulary that make per-slice quality a queryable, reasoned, data-driven rubric.</term>
          </tig>
